### SmartAdmin 示例宿主 —— 定时任务
# 顺序:先跑「处理器清单」拿到可用的 handlerName,再建任务。种子里已有一个内置任务
# sys-job-log-cleanup(执行记录清理),它是内置的,删不掉。

@host = http://localhost:5100
@account = superAdmin
@password = <粘贴首启控制台打印的随机密码>

### 登录 —— 先跑这条
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 已注册的编译类处理器清单 —— 建任务时 handlerName 从这里选,别手打
# sqlEnabled 反映 SmartAdmin:Jobs:Sql:Enabled(默认关);关着还选 SQL 载荷就是 47008
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/handlers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### cron 预览 —— 归一化成 6 段 + 算出未来几次触发时刻
# 用 POST 不是 GET:cron 里有 ? 和 #,走 query 有转义坑
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/preview-cron
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cron": "0 0/5 * * * ?",
  "count": 5
}

### 分页查询任务 —— status:1 就绪 / 2 暂停 / 3 完成 / 4 熔断;handlerKind:1 编译 / 2 HTTP / 3 SQL
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/page?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 新增任务 —— code 创建后不可变(它是排障锚点)
# triggerKind 1 = cron(填 cronExpression)/ 2 = 固定间隔(填 intervalSeconds,≥5)/ 3 = 一次性(填 oneShotTime)
# misfireStrategy 1 跳过 / 2 补跑一次;concurrencyMode 1 串行跳过 / 2 并行
# @name addJob
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "demo-job",
  "name": "示例任务",
  "handlerKind": 1,
  "handlerName": "SmartAdmin.Services.JobLogCleanupJob",
  "triggerKind": 1,
  "cronExpression": "0 0/5 * * * ?",
  "misfireStrategy": 1,
  "concurrencyMode": 1,
  "timeoutSeconds": 60,
  "retryCount": 0,
  "failAlertThreshold": 0,
  "alertByNotice": true,
  "remark": "http 样例建出来的任务,用完删掉"
}

### 立刻执行一次 —— 在收到请求的这台副本上跑,不经选主、不打乱调度节奏
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/{{addJob.response.body.$.data.id}}/run
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 执行记录 —— jobId 过滤;runStatus:1 运行中 / 2 成功 / 3 失败 / 4 超时 / 5 取消 / 6 跳过
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/log/page?jobId={{addJob.response.body.$.data.id}}&current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 暂停 / 恢复调度 —— true 会重算下次执行时刻
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/{{addJob.response.body.$.data.id}}/enabled?enabled=false
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 更新任务 —— code 传了也不改;触发配置一变就重算下次执行时刻
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/{{addJob.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "demo-job",
  "name": "示例任务(改成每 10 分钟)",
  "handlerKind": 1,
  "handlerName": "SmartAdmin.Services.JobLogCleanupJob",
  "triggerKind": 1,
  "cronExpression": "0 0/10 * * * ?",
  "misfireStrategy": 1,
  "concurrencyMode": 1,
  "timeoutSeconds": 60,
  "retryCount": 1,
  "retryIntervalSeconds": 30,
  "failAlertThreshold": 3,
  "alertByNotice": true,
  "remark": null
}

### 监控仪表盘 —— 今日成败 / 在飞 / 状态分布 / 近 14 日趋势 / 即将执行 / 集群节点
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 终止某次执行 —— 跨节点:写终止旗标,目标节点最迟一个轮询周期后停
# 这里的 id 是执行记录 Id(log/page 返回的),不是任务 Id
@jobLogId = <粘贴执行记录的 id>

POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/log/{{jobLogId}}/kill
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 清空执行记录(硬删)—— beforeDays 留空 = 全删;运行中的记录一律保留
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/log/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beforeDays": 30,
  "jobId": {{addJob.response.body.$.data.id}}
}

### 删除任务(软删,可从回收站恢复;内置任务禁删)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sys/job/{{addJob.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
